{
  "tema": 9342,
  "slug": "futuro-progresivo",
  "titulo": "Forming the future progressive with estar + gerund",
  "subtitulo": "Estaré + gerund: will be doing.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Estar in the simple future (estaré, estarás, estará, estaremos, estarán) + gerund (-ando, -iendo): estaré trabajando.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Every tense has a progressive form for an action that is **ongoing**. The **future progressive** works like English _will be doing_."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**estar** in the simple future",
            "gerund"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "estar (simple future)"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "estaré"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "estarás"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "estará"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "estaremos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "estarán"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Verb type",
            "Gerund"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "-ar",
              "-ando (llamando)"
            ],
            [
              "-er, -ir",
              "-iendo (aprendiendo, viviendo)"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "This pattern works for most regular verbs. Some gerunds are irregular: **leyendo**, **durmiendo**, **diciendo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It's always **estar**, never **ser**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **estaré** + **-ando**: a movie you know will be rolling at a future moment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Estaré estudiando== horas para ese examen.",
              "en": "I'll be studying for hours for that exam."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mañana ==estarás haciendo== muchas cosas.",
              "en": "Tomorrow you'll be doing lots of things."
            },
            {
              "es": "Beto ==estará viendo== a su novia esta semana.",
              "en": "Beto will be seeing his girlfriend this week."
            },
            {
              "es": "En la junta ==estaremos hablando== de clientes importantes.",
              "en": "In the meeting we'll be talking about important clients."
            },
            {
              "es": "Ustedes ==estarán disfrutando== de sus vacaciones en Cabo.",
              "en": "You'll be enjoying your vacation in Cabo."
            },
            {
              "es": "En unos minutos ==estarán preparando== la botana.",
              "en": "In a few minutes they'll be preparing the snacks."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
